## Pair (let)
Π(a: Type) -> Π(p: Π(t1: a) -> Type) -> Type

## exampleP1 (let)
Σ($sig: [ fst: Irrelevant, snd: Irrelevant ]) . Schema [ fst: Num, snd: String ]

## exampleP2 (let)
Σ($sig: [ fst: Irrelevant, snd: Irrelevant ]) .
  Schema [ fst: Bool, snd: match ($sig).fst | true -> Num | false -> String ]
